EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

A Bachelors of Engineering education in Osmania Univ. College of Engineering, Hyderabad, an M.Tech from IIT Madras, India; a Second Masters, Doctoral and Post-Doctoral education in the United States; a three year assignment as First Adviser from erstwhile unified Andhra Pradesh in AICTE, New Delhi under Prof. R. Natarajan, former Director, IIT Madras and Chairman, AICTE;recipient of State Award as Meritorious Teacher for 2010 by the Government of Andhra Pradesh; recipient of Excellent Research paper award in an International conference held in 2013;presently Principal Investigator of two live projects from DRDO, New Delhi; as Director-Research and Development, JNTUH, instituted plagiarism prevention checks of all research output emanating from the University resulting in improvement of quality of research;as Founder Director - Academic Audit Cell, JNTUH, developed new and comprehensive college inspection formats for JNTUH in tune with AICTE, Govt. of A.P.and University requirements incorporating both qualitative and quantitative parameters to effectively grade technical institutions and implemented successfully during AY 2009-2012; as Member: Executive Council, JNTUH (2011-2014) and OSD to Vice Chancellor, instrumental in preparing a Vision Document for JNTUH and redesigning a contemporary logo for JNTUH; and effective interaction with various interest groups involving policy makers, academicians, industry leaders, scientists, managements of colleges, students and society - has equipped me with the necessary experience and skill sets to assume a leadership role and provide direction as Vice-chancellor of a reputed University in Telangana.


